      "content": "idk i dont really have time to wait for a doctor appointment before my exams start. i just feel like my heart only races a little bit when i have coffee anyway. like, if i just take one caffeine pill with my dose, it shouldn't be that bad right? i just really need that extra edge to get through this week.",
