    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying but i've seen people online say that caffeine actually helps the ADHD meds work better by leveling out the \"crash\" effect. if i take like 200mg of caffeine with my dose, would that actually help me stay more consistent throughout the day? i just really need to know if there's a way to do it safely so i don't fail these classes.",
